# Copy to apps/web/.env (ignored by Git). Anything here is built into the
# bundle and is readable by anyone who can open the app, so it must never hold
# a DeepSeek key: that lives only in apps/gateway/.env.

# Match GATEWAY_ACCESS_TOKEN in apps/gateway/.env when the gateway requires one.
# It keeps other people on the same network off the gateway; it is not a secret
# from the person using the notebook.
VITE_GATEWAY_ACCESS_TOKEN=
